      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "1. For the purpose of even sparing a preliminary hearing to this review petition, which is addressed against judgment dated 06.06.2017 passed by this Court thereby disposing of a bunch of miscellaneous appeals under Section 173 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 in all of which the petitioner herein figured as a respondent, as being the owner and driver of the offending vehicle who came to suffer burden of payment of compensation, this Court needs to examine the record of all the miscellaneous appeals as to whether the service of the petitioner as a respondent therein had taken place or not.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
